@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- PTI comprehensive health care insurance through Gras Savoye: the rules issued under
-- Decision 268/QĐ-PTI-BHCN of 26 September 2012 by the General Director of PTI
-- (Post and Telecommunication Joint-Stock Insurance Corporation).
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/pti-gras-savoye.txt, the `pdftotext -layout` rendering of
-- pti-gras-savoye.pdf (34 pages, sha256 d2a2a62b...d72f2971), a MIRROR on hcmiu.edu.vn,
-- retrieved 2026-10-06. `src:N` means line N of that text file. Every `-- src:N |` line is
-- generated by tools/vnsrc.py from the file; nothing in Vietnamese here is typed by hand.
--
-- src:1 | QUI TẮC BẢO HIỂM
-- src:2 | BẢO HIỂM CHĂM SÓC SỨC KHỎE TOÀN DIỆN
-- src:3 | QUA GRAS SAVOYE
-- src:8 | (Ban hành theo Quyết định số 268 /QĐ-PTI-BHCN, ngày 26/09/2012 của Tổng Giám đốc
-- src:9 | Tổng Công ty Cổ phần Bảo hiểm Bưu điện)
--
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the
-- fact, or the contract, the schedule, a medical record or an invoice records it. Whether
-- the fact makes a benefit payable is a rule, and belongs in the module for the Part that
-- says so.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND) as a bare NUMBER (III.9), except the amounts the Annex
-- states in US dollars, which are named as such. Rates from the table in Part V are stored
-- as percentages (60 means 60%), as the table prints them.
--
-- WHAT THE SCHEDULE SUPPLIES. The document is the insurer's standard rules. The sums
-- insured, the limits, the benefits chosen, the extension clauses that apply and the
-- dates of the period are written in the contract (Hợp đồng bảo hiểm) and its schedule,
-- which are not in the sources. Each is an input here, with no default.

§ `Nouns`

§§ `The benefits and the extension clauses`

-- Part II numbers the benefits 1 to 7 and the text refers to them by number, so the
-- number is the name.
-- src:366 | A- Các quyền lợi chính
-- src:367 | Quyền lợi 1 - Tử vong hoặc thương tật vĩnh viễn do tai nạn
-- src:372 | Quyền lợi 2 – Chi phí y tế do tai nạn
-- src:381 | Quyền lợi 3 – Tử vong, tàn tật vĩnh viễn do ốm đau, bệnh tật, thai sản
-- src:390 | Quyền lợi 4 - Chi phí nằm viện và phẫu thuật do ốm đau, bệnh tật, thai sản
-- src:408 | B- Các quyền lợi lựa chọn
-- src:409 | Quyền lợi 5 -Trợ cấp ngày (trợ cấp lương) trong thời gian điều trị thương tật do tai
-- src:410 | nạn và nằm viện do bệnh
-- src:429 | Quyền lợi 6 - Điều trị ngoại trú do ốm đau, bệnh tật
-- src:442 | Quyền lợi 7 - Vận chuyển y tế cấp cứu trong lãnh thổ Việt Nam
DECLARE `A benefit` IS ONE OF
    `Benefit 1`    -- death or permanent injury from an accident
    `Benefit 2`    -- medical expenses from an accident
    `Benefit 3`    -- death or permanent disability from illness or maternity
    `Benefit 4`    -- hospitalisation and surgery for illness or maternity
    `Benefit 5`    -- daily allowance while treating an accidental injury or in hospital for illness
    `Benefit 6`    -- outpatient treatment of illness
    `Benefit 7`    -- emergency medical transport within Vietnam (the Annex)

-- The extension clauses of Part VI apply only if the contract names them:
-- src:889 | (Những điều khoản mở rộng sau đây chỉ áp dụng cho hợp đồng này nếu được ghi cụ thể
-- src:890 | trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm)
DECLARE `An extension clause` IS ONE OF
    `the automatic additions and deletions extension`        -- VI.1
    `the premium payment warranty`                           -- VI.2
    `the traditional medicine extension`                     -- VI.3
    `the food or drink poisoning extension`                  -- VI.4
    `the strike, riot and civil commotion extension`         -- VI.5
    `the suffocation and drowning extension`                 -- VI.6
    `the hijacking extension`                                -- VI.7
    `the occupational disease extension`                     -- VI.8
    `the unscheduled flights extension`                      -- VI.9
    `the murder and assault extension`                       -- VI.10
    `the disappearance extension`                            -- VI.11
    `the routine prenatal check extension`                   -- VI.12

§§ `The contract and its schedule`

-- Benefit 5 pays either a salary-based or a fixed daily amount; the schedule says which.
-- src:424 | Lương tháng đã thông báo của người được bảo hiểm /30 ngày X số ngày nghỉ thực tế
-- src:425 | Hoặc
-- src:426 | Trợ cấp cố định theo ngày ghi trên hợp đồng bảo hiểm x số ngày nghỉ thực tế
DECLARE `A basis of daily allowance` IS ONE OF
    `the notified monthly salary`
    `a fixed daily allowance` HAS `the amount per day` IS A NUMBER

-- The two levels of cover the Annex prices (section VI of the Annex):
-- src:1338 | Mức Giới hạn tối đa cho một Giới hạn tối đa cho một Phí bảo hiểm 1 năm
-- src:1339 | năm vụ
-- src:1340 | Mức A USD 50 000 USD 50 000 USD 50
-- src:1341 | Mức B USD 20 000 USD 20 000 USD 20
DECLARE `A level of transport cover` IS ONE OF
    `Level A`
    `Level B`

-- The figures that only the schedule states. Each limit is the one "already selected"
-- ("theo giới hạn đã lựa chọn", Benefits 2 and 4). Fork F27 (NOTES.md): each is read as
-- an aggregate for the period of cover, so what has already been paid is an input.
DECLARE `The limits in the schedule` HAS
    `sum insured under Benefit 1`                  IS A NUMBER
    `limit of Benefit 2`                           IS A NUMBER
    `sum insured under Benefit 3`                  IS A NUMBER
    `limit of Benefit 4`                           IS A NUMBER
    `surgery limit within Benefit 4`               IS A NUMBER
    `room and board limit per day`                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER   -- def 16
    `basis of the daily allowance`                 IS A `A basis of daily allowance`
    `days of allowance chosen`                     IS A NUMBER         -- Benefit 5
    `limit of Benefit 6`                           IS A NUMBER
    `transport level`                              IS A `A level of transport cover`
    `funeral allowance`                            IS A MAYBE NUMBER   -- def 65

-- The contract. Dates are calendar dates. `date the contract takes effect` is the date
-- agreed in the contract (III.8); `last day of the period of cover` is the expiry date
-- (III.6); `date of issue` is the "NGÀY CẤP ĐƠN" of the premium payment warranty (VI.2).
DECLARE `The contract` HAS
    `date the contract takes effect`               IS A DATE
    `last day of the period of cover`              IS A DATE
    `date of issue`                                IS A DATE
    `termination date notified by the policyholder` IS A MAYBE DATE   -- III.6
    `employees insured`                            IS A NUMBER        -- III.8, VI.12
    `persons insured in the group`                 IS A NUMBER        -- IV.A second 32
    `benefits in the schedule`                     IS A LIST OF `A benefit`
    `extension clauses in the contract`            IS A LIST OF `An extension clause`
    `limits`                                       IS A `The limits in the schedule`
    `cover for pre-existing conditions agreed in writing` IS A BOOLEAN  -- III.8, IV.A.13
    `waiting periods varied by the contract`       IS A BOOLEAN       -- III.8
    `territory extended by the contract`           IS A BOOLEAN       -- def 43
    `annual premium`                               IS A NUMBER
    `special activities accepted in writing by PTI, with the additional premium paid` IS A BOOLEAN -- III.12
    `rate of exchange agreed, VND per US dollar`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER  -- III.9

§§ `The insured person`

-- III.1 insures employees and dependants as Part I defines them:
-- src:456 | 1. Đối tượng bảo hiểm
-- src:457 | * PTI nhận bảo hiểm cho các đối tượng sau đây:
-- src:458 |  Nhân viên
-- src:459 |  Người phụ thuộc
-- src:460 | (như định nghĩa tại phần Định nghĩa trên đây)
DECLARE `A role` IS ONE OF
    `an employee`     -- def 41
    `a spouse`        -- def 40
    `a child`         -- def 40

-- `date cover began in this period`: for a person on the list from the start, the date the
-- contract takes effect; for a person added under VI.1, the date the addition took effect.
-- `date first insured with PTI` is def 38's date; `insured continuously since` records
-- whether the contracts were renewed every year without a break (def 38, second sentence).
DECLARE `An insured person` HAS
    `role`                                         IS A `A role`
    `date of birth`                                IS A DATE
    `date first insured with PTI`                  IS A DATE
    `insured continuously since first insured`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `date cover began in this period`              IS A DATE
    `named in the list of insured persons`         IS A BOOLEAN      -- def 39
    `confirmed by PTI`                             IS A BOOLEAN      -- def 40
    `mentally ill or suffering from leprosy`       IS A BOOLEAN      -- III.1(a)
    `degree of permanent disability, in percent`   IS A NUMBER       -- III.1(b)
    `under a labour, probation or other recognised employment contract with the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN -- def 41
    `in a long course of study`                    IS A BOOLEAN      -- def 40, children
    `married`                                      IS A BOOLEAN      -- def 40, children
    `monthly salary notified`                      IS A MAYBE NUMBER -- Benefit 5

§§ `Doctors and places of treatment`

-- Def 1 excludes a doctor who is the insured or a close relative:
-- src:34 | 1. Bác sỹ
-- src:35 | Là người được cấp bằng, hành nghề y hợp pháp, được luật pháp của quốc gia mà điều trị
-- src:36 | phát sinh công nhận và bác sỹ đó đang điều trị, hành nghề trong phạm vi Giấy phép được
-- src:37 | cấp. Loại trừ những bác sỹ chính là Người được bảo hiểm, bố, mẹ, vợ, chồng và con cái hợp
-- src:38 | pháp của Người được bảo hiểm.
DECLARE `A relation to the insured` IS ONE OF
    `no family relation`
    `the insured person`
    `a parent`
    `the spouse`
    `a lawful child`

DECLARE `A doctor` HAS
    `holding a degree and practising lawfully`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `recognised by the law of the country of treatment`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `treating within the scope of the licence`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `relation to the insured`                              IS A `A relation to the insured`

-- Defs 4 and 21 turn on what a place mainly does:
-- src:54 | 4. Bệnh viện
-- src:55 | Là một cơ sở khám chữa bệnh hợp pháp được luật pháp Việt Nam hoặc nước sở tại công
-- src:56 | nhận là bệnh viện
-- src:57 | Hoạt động chính của cơ sở đó không phải là nơi để an dưỡng phục hồi sức khỏe (điều
-- src:58 | dưỡng), phục hồi chức năng hoặc là một nơi đặc biệt chỉ có mục đích duy nhất là phục vụ
-- src:59 | cho người già hoặc giúp đỡ cai nghiện rượu, thuốc phiện, ma tuý hoặc để điều trị rối loạn
-- src:60 | tâm thần, điều trị bệnh phong.
DECLARE `A main activity of a place` IS ONE OF
    `treating the sick`
    `convalescence or rest`
    `rehabilitation`
    `caring only for the elderly`
    `treating alcohol, opium or drug addiction`
    `treating mental disorders`
    `treating leprosy`

DECLARE `A place of treatment` HAS
    `lawful and recognised as a hospital`                  IS A BOOLEAN   -- def 4
    `lawful and licensed for inpatient or outpatient treatment` IS A BOOLEAN -- def 21
    `in Vietnam`                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `main activity`                                        IS A `A main activity of a place`
    `a hospital of traditional medicine`                   IS A BOOLEAN   -- VI.3
    `in the direct billing network`                        IS A BOOLEAN   -- def 33

§§ `The event`

-- src:233 | Quy tắc bảo hiểm này cung cấp bảo hiểm cho những trường hợp bị tai nạn/ốm đau và những
-- src:234 | chi phí y tế liên quan phát sinh trong lãnh thổ Việt Nam ngoại trừ có những quy định khác
-- src:235 | trong Hợp đồng bảo hiểm hoặc Sửa đổi bổ sung.
DECLARE `A kind of event` IS ONE OF
    `an accident`                                           -- def 48
    `an illness`                                            -- def 42
    `childbirth`                                            -- III.8
    `a miscarriage or an abortion on a doctor's indication` -- III.8, def 12
    `a complication of pregnancy`                           -- def 5
    `a pregnancy, for routine prenatal care`                -- VI.12
    `food or drink poisoning`                               -- VI.4
    `suffocation by smoke, toxic fumes or gas, or drowning` -- VI.6

-- The special diseases of def 2, the carve-out for acute nephritis, and a residual.
-- src:39 | 2. Bệnh đặc biệt
-- src:40 | Là những bệnh: ung thư, u các loại, huyết áp, các bệnh về tim, loét dạ dày, viêm đa khớp
-- src:41 | mãn tính, loét ruột, viêm gan, viêm màng trong dạ con, trĩ, sỏi trong hệ thống tiết niệu và
-- src:42 | đường mật, đục thủy tinh thể (đục nhân mắt), bệnh tiểu đường, viêm xoang, viêm amidan
-- src:43 | quá phát, viêm VA quá phát, hen phế quản, parkinson, viêm thận (những ca viêm thận cấp
-- src:44 | tính cần điều trị khẩn cấp không được coi là bệnh đặc biệt, viêm thận cấp tính không bao
-- src:45 | gồm đợt cấp của viêm thận mãn tính), các bệnh và triệu chứng liên quan đến hệ thống tạo
-- src:46 | máu (bao gồm nhưng không giới hạn suy tủy, bạch cầu cấp, bạch cầu mãn).
DECLARE `A diagnosis` IS ONE OF
    `cancer`
    `a tumour of any kind`
    `a blood pressure disease`
    `a heart disease`
    `a stomach ulcer`
    `chronic polyarthritis`
    `an intestinal ulcer`
    `hepatitis`
    `endometritis`
    `haemorrhoids`
    `stones in the urinary system or the bile ducts`
    `cataract`
    `diabetes`
    `sinusitis`
    `hypertrophic tonsillitis`
    `hypertrophic adenoiditis`
    `bronchial asthma`
    `Parkinson's disease`
    `nephritis`
    `acute nephritis needing emergency treatment`
    `an acute flare of chronic nephritis`
    `a disease or symptom of the blood-forming system`
    `another illness or injury`

-- The 21 occupational diseases of VI.8:
-- src:972 | Bệnh nghề nghiệp là bệnh gây ra bởi ảnh hưởng độc hại của điều kiện làm việc của Người
-- src:973 | được bảo hiểm. Bệnh nghề nghiệp bao gồm:
DECLARE `An occupational disease` IS ONE OF
    `lead poisoning`                                       -- (1)
    `benzene poisoning`                                    -- (2)
    `mercury poisoning`                                    -- (3)
    `silicosis`                                            -- (4)
    `asbestosis`                                           -- (5)
    `manganese poisoning`                                  -- (6)
    `X-ray and radiation sickness`                         -- (7)
    `noise-induced deafness`                               -- (8)
    `skin ulcer, nasal septum ulcer, dermatitis or contact eczema` -- (9)
    `occupational skin pigmentation`                       -- (10)
    `occupational vibration disease`                       -- (11)
    `byssinosis`                                           -- (12)
    `occupational tuberculosis`                            -- (13)
    `occupational viral hepatitis`                         -- (14)
    `occupational leptospirosis`                           -- (15)
    `TNT poisoning`                                        -- (16)
    `occupational arsenic poisoning`                       -- (17)
    `occupational nicotine poisoning`                      -- (18)
    `occupational pesticide poisoning`                     -- (19)
    `occupational chronic decompression sickness`          -- (20)
    `occupational chronic bronchitis`                      -- (21)

-- An activity the insured took part in. Def 61 (professional sport) turns on income; def 62
-- (dangerous sport) and III.12 (special cases) list activities.
-- src:323 | 62. Hoạt động thể thao nguy hiểm
-- src:324 | Là các hoạt động trên không (trừ khi đi lại bằng đường hàng không của các hãng hàng
-- src:325 | không đã đăng ký), các môn thể thao mùa đông, môn thể thao bay lượn, săn bắn, hockey
-- src:326 | trên băng, nhảy dù, đấu vật, môn bóng ngựa, môn lướt ván, bơi thuyền buồm cách xa bờ 5
-- src:327 | km, các cuộc đua (không bao gồm các cuộc đua mang tính chất từ thiện, các cuộc đua mang
-- src:328 | tính chất nội bộ do công ty tổ chức).
DECLARE `An activity` IS ONE OF
    `travel by air with a registered airline`
    `another aerial activity`
    `a winter sport`
    `gliding or another flying sport`
    `hunting`
    `ice hockey`
    `parachuting`
    `wrestling`
    `polo`
    `board surfing`
    `wave surfing`
    `sailing more than 5 km from shore`
    `sailing within 5 km of shore`
    `motor racing`
    `horse racing`
    `another race`
    `a charity race`
    `a race organised internally by the company`
    `football`
    `boxing`
    `mountain climbing`
    `air force activity`
    `exploring new lands, or scientific exploration`
    `exploring mountains or the arctic, or serving in an expeditionary force`
    `another activity like those in III.12`
    `an ordinary activity`

-- The facts the general exclusions (Part IV) and the special-cases clause (III.12) turn on.
-- Each constructor is a fact a witness or a record can establish; whether it excludes the
-- claim is a rule (pti268-exclusions.l4). Constructors marked "near miss" are the
-- exceptions the text itself carves out, so that a case can say it falls inside one.
-- src:590 | Các chi phí phát sinh liên quan đến tử vong hoặc thương tật, bệnh tật xảy ra bởi các
-- src:591 | trường hợp sau đây sẽ không được bảo hiểm:
DECLARE `A circumstance` IS ONE OF
    `an intentional act of the insured`                                          -- IV.A.1
    `an intentional act of the insured's lawful heir`                            -- IV.A.1
    `a breach by the insured of the law, or of rules of a local authority or a lawful body` -- IV.A.2
    `a breach of traffic law by the insured`                                     -- IV.A.2
    `the insured under the influence of alcohol or beer above the legal limit`   -- IV.A.3
    `the insured under the influence of another stimulant`                       -- IV.A.3
    `the insured having drunk alcohol within the legal limit`                    -- IV.A.3 near miss
    `a fight the insured took part in`                                           -- IV.A.4
    `a fight the insured took part in, proven to be only in self-defence`        -- IV.A.4 near miss
    `treatment or medicine without a doctor's indication and prescription`       -- IV.A.5
    `treatment not recognised by science, or experimental`                       -- IV.A.5
    `a vaccination`                                                              -- IV.A.5
    `a vaccination needed after an accident or an insect or animal bite`         -- IV.A.5 near miss
    `a vaccination under the newborn care benefit`                               -- IV.A.5 near miss
    `preventive medicine`                                                        -- IV.A.5
    `functional food`                                                            -- IV.A.5
    `aviation other than as a ticketed passenger`                                -- IV.A.6
    `air travel as a ticketed passenger`                                         -- IV.A.6 near miss
    `military training exercises`                                                -- IV.A.6
    `combat with the armed forces`                                               -- IV.A.6
    `an earthquake`                                                              -- IV.A.7
    `a volcanic eruption`                                                        -- IV.A.7
    `radioactive contamination`                                                  -- IV.A.7
    `war`                                                                        -- IV.A.8
    `civil war`                                                                  -- IV.A.8
    `a strike`                                                                   -- IV.A.8
    `terrorism`                                                                  -- IV.A.8
    `a riot or civil commotion`                                                  -- VI.5 (not in IV.A.8)
    `syphilis`                                                                   -- IV.A.9
    `gonorrhoea`                                                                 -- IV.A.9
    `pulmonary tuberculosis`                                                     -- IV.A.9
    `malaria`                                                                    -- IV.A.9
    `leprosy`                                                                    -- IV.A.9
    `treatment of a sexually transmitted disease`                                -- IV.A.10
    `an illness related to HIV or AIDS`                                          -- IV.A.10
    `treatment at home, other than by a home care nurse`                         -- IV.A.11
    `care by a home care nurse`                                                  -- IV.A.11 near miss
    `treatment at a hydrotherapy or natural-methods institute, a spa, a sanatorium or a similar place` -- IV.A.11
    `treatment of a mental illness`                                              -- IV.A.12
    `an acute mental disorder whose symptoms end once treatment stabilises it`   -- IV.A.12 near miss
    `a psychological disorder`                                                   -- IV.A.12
    `memory impairment`                                                          -- IV.A.12
    `neurasthenia`                                                               -- IV.A.12
    `physical debility with no specific pathological cause`                     -- IV.A.12
    `fatigue`                                                                    -- IV.A.12
    `stress`                                                                     -- IV.A.12
    `a sleep disorder`                                                           -- IV.A.12
    `treatment of premenopause or menopause`                                     -- IV.A.12
    `treatment or surgery related to reproduction`                               -- IV.A.14
    `maternity care of a pregnancy by artificial insemination or in vitro fertilisation` -- IV.A.15
    `a periodic health check, or a check before travel or work`                  -- IV.A.16
    `a hospital stay or consultation only for a check, unrelated to treatment`   -- IV.A.16
    `a gynaecological or andrological examination to treat an illness`          -- IV.A.16 near miss
    `a routine prenatal check`                                                   -- IV.A.16
    `a routine eye or hearing test`                                              -- IV.A.16
    `surgery or treatment of a degenerative defect of hearing or sight`          -- IV.A.16
    `a refractive error of the eye`                                              -- IV.A.16
    `eye strain`                                                                 -- IV.A.16
    `surgery to restore sight`                                                   -- IV.A.17
    `cataract surgery for a pathological cause`                                  -- IV.A.17 near miss
    `treatment or surgery at the insured's request, not on a doctor's indication` -- IV.A.18
    `routine treatment as prescribed by the Ministry of Health`                 -- IV.A.18
    `orthopaedics or rehabilitation that does not follow treatment of an illness` -- IV.A.19
    `upkeep or repair of a prosthesis or an artificial device`                   -- IV.A.20
    `a dietary supplement available without prescription`                        -- IV.A.21
    `family planning`                                                            -- IV.A.22
    `infertility treatment`                                                      -- IV.A.22
    `purchase of a prosthesis that does not sustain life`                        -- IV.A.23
    `cosmetic treatment or surgery`                                              -- IV.A.24
    `treatment at a doctor's private clinic outside office hours, with no financial invoice` -- IV.A.25
    `weight control treatment`                                                   -- IV.A.26
    `treatment or surgery of a congenital defect or disease, or a genetic malformation` -- IV.A.27
    `taking part in an activity` HAS `the activity`                         IS AN `An activity`
                                     `the insured's main and regular source of income` IS A BOOLEAN -- def 61
                                     `in training`                           IS A BOOLEAN -- IV.A.28
                                     `in a match or a race`                  IS A BOOLEAN -- IV.A.28, III.12
    `purchase, upkeep, fitting or repair of spectacles, crutches, a wheelchair, a hearing or sight aid or an orthopaedic device` -- IV.A.29
    `extraction of a milk tooth`                                                 -- IV.A.30
    `examinations and tests without a doctor's conclusion of illness`           -- IV.A.31
    `an epidemic declared by a competent authority`                              -- IV.A.32 (the first)
    `asphyxiation caused by the insured's own intentional act`                   -- VI.6 proviso
    `the insured taking part in or provoking the hijacking`                      -- VI.7 proviso
    `the insured causing, cooperating in or supporting the assault`              -- VI.10 proviso
    `a hijacking or an unlawful act of passengers while the insured was a ticketed passenger` -- VI.7
    `an attempted murder or an unprovoked assault`                               -- VI.10

-- The event the claim arises from. `date` is the day of the accident, the onset of the
-- illness, or the delivery. The three pre-existing-condition dates are the facts def 58
-- turns on; NOTHING where there was no such treatment or knowledge.
DECLARE `An event` HAS
    `kind`                                                   IS A `A kind of event`
    `date`                                                   IS A DATE
    `in Vietnam`                                             IS A BOOLEAN   -- def 43
    `sudden, unforeseen, outside the insured's control and by a visible external force` IS A BOOLEAN -- def 48
    `diagnosis`                                              IS A `A diagnosis`
    `date the condition first existed`                       IS A DATE      -- def 58
    `date of the latest treatment of the condition before cover` IS A MAYBE DATE -- def 58(a)
    `date the insured first knew of the condition or its symptoms` IS A MAYBE DATE -- def 58(b)
    `date surgery was first indicated`                       IS A MAYBE DATE -- IV.A.13
    `circumstances`                                          IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
    `occupational disease`                                   IS A MAYBE `An occupational disease` -- VI.8
    `contracted while working for the policyholder`          IS A BOOLEAN   -- VI.8
    `a clear conclusion of a medical authority on the pathology` IS A BOOLEAN -- Benefit 3
    `the direct cause of the death or disability`            IS A BOOLEAN   -- Benefits 1 and 3
    `from a cause independent of all other causes`           IS A BOOLEAN   -- III.6

§§ `The table of injury rates (Part V)`

-- src:686 | V. BẢNG TỈ LỆ THƯƠNG TẬT
-- src:687 | Quyền lợi Tỷ lệ trả tiền
DECLARE `A part of the table` IS ONE OF
    `I, death`
    `II, total permanent injury`
    `III, partial permanent injury`

-- The headings of section III of the table, in the order printed:
DECLARE `A region of the body` IS ONE OF
    `no region`            -- sections I and II
    `upper limb`           -- CHI TRÊN
    `lower limb`           -- CHI DƯỚI
    `spine`                -- CỘT SỐNG
    `skull and brain`      -- SỌ NÃO
    `chest`                -- LỒNG NGỰC
    `abdomen`              -- BỤNG
    `urinary and genital organs` -- CƠ QUAN TIẾT NIỆU, SINH DỤC
    `eyes`                 -- MẮT
    `ear, nose and throat` -- TAI – MŨI – HỌNG
    `face`                 -- MẶT

-- One printed line of the table. `item number` is the number printed (1 to 93; 0 for section I,
-- which prints no number); `sub-row number` counts the printed lines of that item that carry a
-- rate, from 1, in the order printed (so item 28, whose own line has no rate, has sub-rows
-- 1 "upper third" and 2 "middle or lower third").
-- Rates are percentages of the sum insured, as printed; a single figure has
-- `lowest rate` equal to `highest rate`.
DECLARE `A row of the table` HAS
    `item number`     IS A NUMBER
    `sub-row number`  IS A NUMBER
    `part`            IS A `A part of the table`
    `region`          IS A `A region of the body`
    `lowest rate`     IS A NUMBER
    `highest rate`    IS A NUMBER

-- Principle 5 of the table caps several injuries to one limb at the rate for losing it.
DECLARE `A limb` IS ONE OF
    `the left arm`
    `the right arm`
    `the left leg`
    `the right leg`

-- Principles 3 and 4 of the table: where in its range a listed injury is paid.
-- src:865 | 3) Vết thương điều trị bình thường, vết thương không bị nhiễm trùng sẽ được trả tiền bảo
-- src:866 | hiểm tương ứng với mức thấp nhất của thang tỉ lệ trả tiền bảo hiểm quy định cho trường
-- src:867 | hợp này.
-- src:868 | 4) Vết thương điều trị phức tạp, vết thương bị nhiễm trùng hoặc sau khi điều trị còn để lại
-- src:869 | di chứng thì tùy theo mức độ nặng, nhẹ được trả cao dần cho tới mức tối đa của thang tỉ
-- src:870 | lệ trả tiền bảo hiểm quy định cho trường hợp này.
DECLARE `A course of healing` IS ONE OF
    `normal healing, without infection`
    `complicated, infected, or leaving sequelae` HAS `the rate assessed, in percent` IS A NUMBER

-- An injury as the claim presents it. Principle 2 pays an unlisted injury by comparing
-- its severity with the listed ones; that comparison is the insurer's, so its result is
-- the input `the rate assessed by comparison, in percent`.
DECLARE `An injury` IS ONE OF
    `a listed injury` HAS `item number`    IS A NUMBER
                          `sub-row number` IS A NUMBER
                          `course`       IS A `A course of healing`
                          `re-operated`  IS A BOOLEAN
                          `limb`         IS A MAYBE `A limb`
    `an injury not listed in the table` HAS `the rate assessed by comparison, in percent` IS A NUMBER
                                            `re-operated`  IS A BOOLEAN
                                            `limb`         IS A MAYBE `A limb`

§§ `Treatment and expenses`

-- src:145 | 24. Điều trị ngoại trú
-- src:146 | Là việc người được bảo hiểm được điều trị tại một cơ sở y tế khám chữa bệnh có giấy phép
-- src:147 | hoạt động hợp pháp mà không phải nằm viện, không phải là điều trị nội trú, không phải là
-- src:148 | điều trị trong ngày.
-- src:149 | 25. Điều trị nội trú
-- src:150 | Là điều trị y tế khi Người được bảo hiểm có làm thủ tục nhập viện và nằm tại giường bệnh
-- src:151 | qua đêm. Giấy xuất viện là chứng từ cần thiết để yêu cầu bồi thường cho quyền lợi này.
-- src:162 | 27. Điều trị trong ngày
-- src:163 | Là việc điều trị y tế khi người được bảo hiểm cần thiết phải làm thủ tục nhập viện và phải
-- src:164 | điều trị trên giường bệnh nhưng không phải ở lại bệnh viện qua đêm. Giấy xuất viện là
-- src:165 | chứng từ cần thiết để yêu cầu bồi thường cho quyền lợi này.
DECLARE `A setting of treatment` IS ONE OF
    `inpatient treatment`      -- def 25
    `day treatment`            -- def 27
    `outpatient treatment`     -- def 24

-- One course of treatment. For outpatient treatment the first and last day are the day
-- of the visit; `date of the diagnosis result` is the day VII counts from for outpatients.
DECLARE `A course of treatment` HAS
    `setting`                          IS A `A setting of treatment`
    `first day`                        IS A DATE
    `last day`                         IS A DATE
    `date of the diagnosis result`     IS A DATE
    `admitted with formalities`        IS A BOOLEAN    -- defs 25, 27
    `stayed overnight`                 IS A BOOLEAN    -- def 25
    `continuous hours in hospital`     IS A NUMBER     -- def 35
    `on a doctor's indication`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the place`                        IS A `A place of treatment`
    `the treating doctor`              IS A `A doctor`
    `after childbirth`                 IS A BOOLEAN    -- def 69

-- The dental treatments Benefit 6 item 4 lists, and a residual:
-- src:439 | 4. Điều trị răng cho các trường hợp: điều trị viêm lợi (nướu), hàn (trám) răng bệnh lý (bằng
-- src:440 | amalgam, composite, fuji, gic hoặc các chất trám tương tự khác), điều trị tuỷ răng và nhổ
-- src:441 | răng bệnh lý, nhổ & phẫu thuật răng khôn bệnh lý, lấy cao răng (cạo vôi răng).
DECLARE `A dental treatment` IS ONE OF
    `treatment of gingivitis`
    `filling of a diseased tooth`
    `root canal treatment`
    `extraction of a diseased tooth`
    `extraction or surgery of a diseased wisdom tooth`
    `scaling`
    `another dental treatment`

-- What an item on an invoice paid for. Benefits 2, 4 and 6 list what they pay; Part I
-- defines some further heads (taxi, ambulance, home nursing, newborn care) that no clause
-- of Part II grants (NOTES.md, finding X7).
DECLARE `A head of expense` IS ONE OF
    `emergency care`
    `surgery`
    `a therapeutic procedure`                         -- Benefit 4: within 50% of the surgery limit
    `a diagnostic procedure`                          -- Benefit 4: not a surgery cost
    `an organ transplant`                             -- def 11
    `obtaining the organ, or the donor's costs`       -- def 11: not insured
    `room and board` HAS `days` IS A NUMBER           -- defs 15, 16
    `medicine`
    `vitamins and tonics` HAS `cost of the main medicine on the same prescription` IS A NUMBER
                              `bought and used to treat the illness or injury`     IS A BOOLEAN -- def 52
    `consumables`                                     -- def 8
    `replacement materials that sustain life`         -- defs 9, 10
    `a prosthesis implanted to sustain life`          -- def 7, Benefit 4
    `tests, ultrasound, X-ray and CT scans`
    `dental crowns or false teeth of ordinary material`   -- Benefit 2
    `dental crowns or false teeth of precious material`   -- Benefit 2: not paid
    `another prosthesis`                              -- Benefit 2
    `a consultation`                                  -- Benefit 6.1
    `medical devices for a fracture or an injury, or a walking aid` -- Benefit 6.2
    `radiation, heat or light therapy`                -- Benefit 6.3
    `dental treatment` HAS `the treatment` IS A `A dental treatment` -- Benefit 6.4
    `traditional medicine`                            -- VI.3
    `a prenatal check-up or ultrasound`               -- VI.12
    `a urine test or blood count in pregnancy`        -- VI.12
    `tests in the 30 days before admission`           -- def 28
    `treatment in the 45 days after discharge`        -- def 26
    `a home care nurse` HAS `days` IS A NUMBER        -- def 69
    `an emergency taxi`                               -- def 14
    `an ambulance`                                    -- def 22
    `newborn care`                                    -- def 13

DECLARE `An item of expense` HAS
    `head`                 IS A `A head of expense`
    `amount`               IS A NUMBER
    `date incurred`        IS A DATE
    `with a VAT invoice`   IS A BOOLEAN          -- VII, note at the end

§§ `The outcome claimed`

-- What the claim says happened, one constructor per kind of benefit Part II pays.
DECLARE `An outcome` IS ONE OF
    `death` HAS `in hospital` IS A BOOLEAN
    `total permanent injury` HAS `the row of the table, if listed` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
                                 `lasting 52 consecutive weeks with no hope of improvement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `partial permanent injury` HAS `the injuries` IS A LIST OF `An injury`
    `medical expenses` HAS `the treatment` IS A `A course of treatment`
                           `the items`     IS A LIST OF `An item of expense`
    `daily allowance` HAS `the days off` IS A `The days off`
    `emergency transport` HAS `the transport` IS A `The transport`
    `disappearance` HAS `declared missing by a court` IS A BOOLEAN
                        `the insurer concluded from the evidence that a bodily injury caused death` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The claim and its file`

-- The other insurance III.11 speaks of, where there is any.
DECLARE `Other insurance` HAS
    `amount recoverable under the other policies`   IS A NUMBER
    `total limits of all the policies`              IS A NUMBER

-- The documents Part VII asks for (I inpatient, II outpatient, III accident).
-- src:1094 | Hồ sơ bồi thường
-- src:1095 | Người được bảo hiểm phải cung cấp các giấy tờ sau:
DECLARE `A claim document` IS ONE OF
    `a claim form stamped by the policyholder and signed by an authorised person`  -- I.1, II.1
    `the indications and results of tests before admission`                        -- I.2
    `invoices for tests before admission, with an itemised statement`              -- I.2
    `the discharge paper`                                                          -- I.3
    `the surgery certificate`                                                      -- I.3
    `invoices for the hospital stay`                                               -- I.3
    `an itemised statement of hospital fees`                                       -- I.3
    `the indication for follow-up after discharge`                                 -- I.4
    `the prescription after discharge`                                             -- I.4
    `invoices for follow-up after discharge`                                       -- I.4
    `the medical record book or examination slip`                                  -- II.2
    `the prescription`                                                             -- II.3
    `the indications and results of tests`                                         -- II.4
    `invoices for examination and tests, itemised`                                 -- II.5
    `invoices for medicine`                                                        -- II.6
    `an accident report confirmed and stamped by the policyholder`                 -- III.1
    `an accident report by the insured or the beneficiary`                         -- III.2
    `an accident record confirmed by the police or the local authority`            -- III.3
    `copies of the driving licence and vehicle registration`                       -- III.3
    `the doctor's indication of leave, and HR's confirmation of the days off`      -- III.3
    `the death certificate, and papers proving the right to inherit`               -- III.3

DECLARE `A kind of accident` IS ONE OF
    `an accident at work`          -- VII III.1
    `an accident in daily life`    -- VII III.2
    `a traffic accident`           -- VII III.3

-- The file and its dates. NOTHING where the thing has not happened.
DECLARE `The claim file` HAS
    `through the direct billing network`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `kind of accident`                                      IS A MAYBE `A kind of accident`
    `a serious traffic accident, fatal or involving a third party` IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the claim file was submitted`                     IS A DATE
    `date the accident was notified in writing`             IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the documents were sent`                          IS A DATE
    `date supplementary documents were requested`           IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date supplementary documents were submitted`           IS A MAYBE DATE
    `force majeure`                                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `an invoice lumps several kinds of cost together`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `documents supplied`                                    IS A LIST OF `A claim document`

-- The claim. `date of the loss` is the day of the treatment, death, disablement or
-- transport the benefit pays for (the first day, for a course of treatment).
-- `paid already under this benefit in the period` feeds the aggregate limits (fork F27).
DECLARE `A claim` HAS
    `the contract`                                          IS A `The contract`
    `the insured person`                                    IS AN `An insured person`
    `the event`                                             IS AN `An event`
    `the benefit claimed`                                   IS A `A benefit`
    `the outcome`                                           IS AN `An outcome`
    `date of the loss`                                      IS A DATE
    `paid already under this benefit in the period`         IS A NUMBER
    `other insurance`                                       IS A MAYBE `Other insurance`
    `fraud or dishonest declaration by the insured or the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN -- III.10
    `date the premium was paid in full`                     IS A MAYBE DATE     -- III.2, VI.2
    `date the request to renew was confirmed`               IS A MAYBE DATE     -- III.3
    `renewal premium paid in full`                          IS A BOOLEAN        -- III.3
    `the file`                                              IS A `The claim file`

§§ `The general exclusions (Part IV)`

-- Part IV numbers its exclusions 1 to 32 and then prints a second "32" (line 674). The
-- second is named as such rather than renumbered.
-- src:587 | IV. NHỮNG ĐIỂM LOẠI TRỪ
-- src:588 | A. CÁC LOẠI TRỪ CHUNG ÁP DỤNG CHO CÁC ĐIỀU KIỆN BẢO HIỂM
-- src:589 | (BAO GỒM CẢ CÁC ĐIỀU KHOẢN MỞ RỘNG)
DECLARE `A general exclusion` IS ONE OF
    `exclusion 1`, `exclusion 2`, `exclusion 3`, `exclusion 4`, `exclusion 5`, `exclusion 6`,
    `exclusion 7`, `exclusion 8`, `exclusion 9`, `exclusion 10`, `exclusion 11`, `exclusion 12`,
    `exclusion 13`, `exclusion 14`, `exclusion 15`, `exclusion 16`, `exclusion 17`,
    `exclusion 18`, `exclusion 19`, `exclusion 20`, `exclusion 21`, `exclusion 22`,
    `exclusion 23`, `exclusion 24`, `exclusion 25`, `exclusion 26`, `exclusion 27`,
    `exclusion 28`, `exclusion 29`, `exclusion 30`, `exclusion 31`, `exclusion 32`,
    `the second exclusion 32`

§§ `Cancellation, membership changes, and what is known of a missing person`

-- src:489 | 4. Hủy toàn bộ hợp đồng bảo hiểm
-- src:490 | PTI hoặc Chủ hợp đồng bảo hiểm có thể hủy hợp đồng bảo hiểm bằng cách gửi thông báo
-- src:491 | bằng văn bản cho bên kia trong vòng 30 ngày trước ngày hủy, tới địa chỉ được thông báo
-- src:492 | lần cuối cùng của họ. Nếu PTI gửi thông báo này, Chủ hợp đồng bảo hiểm hoặc người được
DECLARE `A cancelling party` IS ONE OF
    `PTI cancels`
    `the policyholder cancels`

-- VI.1: the kinds of change the automatic additions and deletions clause speaks of.
-- src:891 | 1. ĐIỀU KHOẢN VỀ TỰ ĐỘNG THÊM HOẶC BỚT NGƯỜI ĐƯỢC BẢO HIỂM
-- src:892 | Đơn bảo hiểm này tự động mở rộng bảo hiểm cho các nhân viên mới của Chủ Hợp đồng
DECLARE `A kind of membership change` IS ONE OF
    `a new employee`                                -- covered from the first day of work
    `an employee leaving`                           -- cover ends when the labour contract ends
    `a dependant added`                             -- accepted once a period
    `a dependant removed`                           -- accepted once a period
    `a dependant added on the employee's marriage or a birth` -- from the day declared
    `a dependant removed on divorce or the dependant's death` -- from the day declared

DECLARE `A membership change` HAS
    `kind`                                                    IS A `A kind of membership change`
    `date of the change`                                      IS A DATE  -- first day of work, end of the labour contract, or day declared
    `notified in writing at the end of the month and confirmed by PTI` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sum insured requested`                                   IS A NUMBER
    `sum insured of employees doing the same kind of work`    IS A NUMBER
    `dependant changes already accepted in the period`        IS A NUMBER
    `a claim has arisen for the person by the date of the change` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Def 34: what is known of the last news of a missing person.
DECLARE `What is known of the last news` IS ONE OF
    `the day of the last news`  HAS `the day`   IS A DATE
    `only the month`            HAS `the month` IS A NUMBER
                                    `the year`  IS A NUMBER
    `only the year`             HAS `the year`  IS A NUMBER

§§ `Disputes (III.14)`

-- src:578 | 14. Tranh chấp
-- src:579 | Tất cả các tranh chấp phát sinh từ hay theo Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này nếu không đươc giải
-- src:580 | quyết được bằng thương lượng thì sẽ được giải quyết theo sự phán quyết của tòa án có thẩm
-- src:581 | quyền trong lãnh thổ Việt Nam và theo pháp luật hiện hành.
DECLARE `A forum` IS ONE OF
    `negotiation between the parties`
    `a competent court in Vietnam, under the law in force`

§§ `The call to the assistance centre (Annex III)`

-- src:1305 | Để công ty cứu trợ có thể quyết định biện pháp trợ giúp, người được bảo hiểm phải cung
-- src:1306 | cấp những thông tin sau đây khi liên hệ:
-- src:1307 | Tên người được bảo hiểm, số hợp đồng bảo hiểm và ngày hết hạn.
-- src:1308 | Số điện thoại và địa điểm có thể liên hệ.
-- src:1309 | Mô tả vắn tắt tình trạng và bản chất của tình trạng cần được cứu trợ.
DECLARE `A call to the assistance centre` HAS
    `name, policy number and expiry date given`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `telephone number and location given`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `short description of the condition given`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `hours from admission to notifying the assistance company`  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the medical team allowed access to the insured`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `a reasonable excuse for not complying`                     IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Daily allowance and emergency transport`

-- Benefit 5 counts actual days off, on a doctor's indication and confirmed by HR.
DECLARE `The days off` HAS
    `days off on a doctor's indication, confirmed by HR` IS A NUMBER
    `of which days as an inpatient`                      IS A NUMBER

-- src:1290 | 6. Thu xếp và thanh toán vận chuyển thi hài trở về nơi cư trú
DECLARE `A transport service` IS ONE OF
    `emergency medical transport to the nearest suitable hospital`   -- Annex II.4
    `transport home after an emergency transport`                    -- Annex II.5
    `transport of the remains home, or burial where death occurred`  -- Annex II.6

DECLARE `The transport` HAS
    `service`                                              IS A `A transport service`
    `cost, in US dollars`                                  IS A NUMBER
    `consecutive days away from the declared residence`    IS A NUMBER     -- Annex intro
    `within Vietnam`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `in a critical condition`                              IS A BOOLEAN    -- Annex II.4
    `the necessary treatment unavailable where the accident happened` IS A BOOLEAN -- Annex II.4
    `approved by PTI beforehand`                           IS A BOOLEAN    -- Annex II.4, II.6
    `certified by the treating doctor as unavailable there` IS A BOOLEAN   -- Annex II.4
    `transport costs already paid in the period, in US dollars` IS A NUMBER
    `the call`                                             IS A `A call to the assistance centre`

§§ `Parties and acts, for the duties`

DECLARE `A party` IS ONE OF
    `the policyholder`
    `PTI`
    `the insured person or their heir`
    `the assistance company`

DECLARE `An act` IS ONE OF
    `pay the premium`
    `send written notice of cancellation`
    `confirm the request to renew`
    `notify the changes of employees in writing`
    `submit the claim file`
    `submit the supplementary documents`
    `notify the accident in writing`
    `send the claim documents`
    `pay the claim`
    `notify the assistance company of the admission`
    `refund the benefit obtained by fraud`
    `repay the death benefit`
    `pay the costs above the limit or outside the cover`
